a couple obstacles. Obstacles that the packaging design would help overcome. First of all, the pill marked a big turning point in the pharmaceutical industry. Before birth control, only sick people took pharmaceutical drugs. The birth control pill was one of the first prescriptions intended to be taken by healthy Americans. And so, pharmaceutical companies designed the packaging to look not like medicine, but instead like an ordinary everyday object. They began packaging the pills and circular plastic cases
